.TH DANBY-ROCKET2D 1
.SH NAME
danby-rocket2d \- finite-burn two-dimensional rocket ascent
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/rocket2d
.SH MODEL
Variable-mass thrust acts along a selected pitch angle until burnout. Gravity
and altitude-dependent drag then shape the downrange trajectory.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/rocket2d.b
